### Course CRUD — spring-cloud-sleuth-zipkin (distributed tracing)
# After running a request, check the app logs for a traceId, and open
# Zipkin at http://localhost:9411 to see the request timeline.
# Note: the controller is mapped at BOTH /courses and /api/courses.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Create a course (note the JSON field names from @JsonProperty)
POST {{host}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Boot Mastery",
  "c_desc": "From basics to microservices",
  "price": 49.99
}

### Get all courses
GET {{host}}/courses

### Get one course by id
GET {{host}}/courses/1

### Update a course
PUT {{host}}/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Boot Mastery (2026)",
  "c_desc": "Updated for Spring Boot 3.3",
  "price": 59.99
}

### Paginated list
GET {{host}}/courses/pagination?page=0&size=5

### Delete a course
DELETE {{host}}/courses/1

### --- Observability ---
### Health (Actuator)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health
